<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Protection from Good</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 32), Necromancer (guild level 33)
Also taught by: Kaare, in the back room of the inn in Udgaard (anyone, up to 35%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast protection from good &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast protection from good</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Wards the target against good. Whenever someone of good alignment attacks 
them, monster or player, the target defends better against their blows and 
against their attack spells. It doesn't keep anyone from attacking.
</p><p>The better your divine power and your skill in the spell, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. It doesn't add up on someone who already has it. A dispel 
evil cast at the warded one breaks the ward first. You must be standing, not 
fighting. It is also found on scrolls. Practising 
it needs divine 60.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection from Evil</a>
